<div id="S2.F2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.F2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">(a)<span id="S2.F2.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The within-task game is a <span id="S2.F2.p2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">SingleEpisodeEnv</span>; its latents, prompts, and feedbacks live in their own files and register on import. Number guessing in eight lines.</span></span></p>
</div>
        
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
