</span></td>
<td id="S2.T2.3.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S2.T2.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:117.3pt;">
