<span id="S3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.p2.p3.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.p2.p3.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#1E3773;">Agent (turn 1):</span><span id="S3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.p2.p3.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;"> Let me start with binary search again. [500]</span></span>
