<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span><span id="S4.T6.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Generalization under latent shift (OOD-1).</span>
Cross-task RL beats the base by an average of 55% and single-task RL by 26% on cumulative reward.
</figcaption>
