<div id="A4.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="828.97" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 828.97" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,828.97) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#445277;" fill="#445277" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.43 L 0 824.55 C 0 826.99 1.98 828.97 4.43 828.97 L 472.95 828.97 C 475.39 828.97 477.38 826.99 477.38 824.55 L 477.38 4.43 C 477.38 1.98 475.39 0 472.95 0 L 4.43 0 C 1.98 0 0 1.98 0 4.43 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9FB;" fill="#F9F9FB" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.97 4.43 L 0.97 808.09 L 476.41 808.09 L 476.41 4.43 C 476.41 2.52 474.86 0.97 472.95 0.97 L 4.43 0.97 C 2.52 0.97 0.97 2.52 0.97 4.43 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#50618D;" fill="#50618D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.97 809.06 L 0.97 824.55 C 0.97 826.46 2.52 828.01 4.43 828.01 L 472.95 828.01 C 474.86 828.01 476.41 826.46 476.41 824.55 L 476.41 809.06 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 15.98 815.42)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.23em;--ltx-fo-height:0.63em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="418.3"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.23em;">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Gemini does not try to identify any pattern</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 15.98 209.73)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.19em;--ltx-fo-height:42.56em;--ltx-fo-depth:14.4em;font-size:10pt;" height="788.19" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 588.9)" width="445.42"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:32.19em;">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Category:</span><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Failure to adapt across tasks</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Model:</span><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Gemini 2.5 Flash</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Configuration:</span><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Environment: number_guessing. Latent: range_100. Prompt: no_info. Feedback: standard. Trajectory: 0.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Setup.<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p7.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Range is fixed across tasks. Gemini’s openings on tasks 1, 5 and 9 do not narrow.</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p7.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p7.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">What went wrong.<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p7.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Cross-task range structure not internalized.</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p7.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p7.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Per-task summary<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p7.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> (<math id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\star" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">⋆</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\star</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p7.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> marks tasks whose transcript is shown below</span>).</span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Agent task is to identify a hidden integer between 1 and 1000; after each guess, the game master replies whether the target is greater than, less than, or equal to the guess.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p2.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Hidden latent: range = [1, 100]</span></span>
</span>
