<br class="ltx_break">  
<br class="ltx_break"> Okay, I’m kicking things off with Game 8. My initial strategy? A binary search. To maximize efficiency right from the get-go, I’m setting my first guess at 500, the midpoint of the 1-1000 range. That’s the optimal starting point for narrowing down the possibilities.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
