<span id="A4.SS1.p3.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p3.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Claude does not try to identify any pattern</span></span>
